1
00:00:00,366 --> 00:00:01,400
hey Joe

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:04,566
what are you doing today hi Sharon

3
00:00:04,566 --> 00:00:06,933
Today is our yearly spring cleaning

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,166
what exactly is it

5
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:12,800
it's the day we completely clean the entire house

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,033
we throw away stuff we don't need

7
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:17,133
and pack up items to donate

8
00:00:17,466 --> 00:00:19,366
we also clean all of the rooms

9
00:00:19,366 --> 00:00:21,300
and wash all of the windows

10
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:24,566
that's a lot to do yes

11
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:26,400
it takes the entire day

12
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,100
do your children assist you

13
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,900
of course they sort clothes and toys in the closet

14
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,900
and toy bins to donate or throw away

15
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:40,366
great but why is it referred to as spring cleaning

16
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:43,400
simply because it's spring now

17
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,900
I see

18
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,366
I think my family also needs a cleaning day like this

19
00:00:48,366 --> 00:00:50,266
our home is quite messy

20
00:00:50,666 --> 00:00:53,833
Jim delivers the items to the local homeless shelter

21
00:00:53,833 --> 00:00:56,333
after we have them ready for donation

22
00:00:56,966 --> 00:00:59,066
this makes cleaning the house simpler

23
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,200
it's a meaningful job I'll tell my family about it

24
00:01:03,733 --> 00:01:05,733
well I'd best get started

25
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,100
I have a lot to accomplish

26
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,500
so I'll chat with you later Sharon

27
00:01:09,966 --> 00:01:10,966
Goodbye Joe

28
00:01:10,966 --> 00:01:12,666
thanks for the cleaning tip

